# Brand protection — reserved username list

Reserved handles are held by the canister so **no one else can claim or buy
them**, while the future sale-from-hold feature is planned. Reserving does **not**
sell a name — it blocks it. It is fully reversible with `releaseUsername`.

`reserveUsername` / `releaseUsername` / `listReservedUsernames` are
**controller-only** (`Principal.isController`), so only the canister controller
can manage this list — no ordinary user and no stored role.

